    {
      "id": "bf268c9648f626e3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1980,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 650,
      "text": "## 关系索引\n\n**E01** · Apple → 外部:Ford\nApple Maps EV routing and in-vehicle navigation experience for Ford Universal EV Platform\n\n**E02** · 外部:AMD → Microsoft\nAMD Helios、EPYC 与 Azure HDv2/HXv2/ND MI455X v7 计划\n\n**E03** · 外部:Mistral → Microsoft\nFrontier AI model services and controllable deployment for enterprises and regulated industries\n\n**E04** · Alphabet / Google → 外部:Google Cloud customers\nGoogle Cloud AI 与云服务需求\n\n**E05** · 外部:Anthropic → Amazon / AWS\nClaude Opus 5 availability on Amazon Bedrock\n\n**E06** · Meta → 外部:Meta users and advertising ecosystem\nFacebook, Instagram, Threads, WhatsApp services and advertising systems\n\n**E07** · NVIDIA → 外部:SK Group / SK Telecom\nNVIDIA AI infrastructure for AI factories and SK Telecom 2GW AI infrastructure\n\n**E08** · SK Hynix → NVIDIA\nNext-generation memory and HBM/AI memory ecosystem",
      "color": "#334155"
    },
    {
      "id": "dd52617dfea274aa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 1980,
      "width": 580,
      "height": 370,
      "text": "## 关系索引\n\n**E09** · Samsung Electronics → 外部:Broadcom\nMemory, foundry, advanced packaging and AI semiconductor technologies\n\n**E10** · Tesla → 外部:EV and energy storage customers\nElectric vehicles, energy storage deployment and energy ecosystem\n\n**E11** · TSMC → NVIDIA\nAdvanced-node foundry cost exposure for AI GPUs and AI ASICs\n\n**E12** · TSMC → Apple\nAdvanced-node foundry cost exposure for A/M series chips",
      "color": "#334155"
    }
  ],
